<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112547" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῠλᾰκ-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>preservative,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ληπτικός, προετικός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1120b15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγιείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Top.</u>
					106b36
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1366a37
			</span></i>; of persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. τῶν ὄντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.4.9
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ἐγκλημάτων</span>
			<i>cherishing the recollection of</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1381b4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					p.34J.
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.638
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Antr.</u>
				16
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Top.</u>
					106b37
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (from 
				Med.
			) <i>cautious,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιστευτικός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1372b28
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.8.3
				</span></i>
			, al.: 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερον χρῆσθαι ταῖς προνομαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.18.1
				</span></i>
			, al.</div>
